"entity": {
"name": "NIQ Global Intelligence PLC",
"description": "NIQ Global Intelligence Plc is a global consumer intelligence company positioned at the nexus of brands, retailers and consumers. It manages a comprehensive and integrated ecosystem, NIQ Ecosystem, which combines proprietary data, technology, human intelligence and highly sophisticated software applications and analytics solutions. The firm's unified, artificial intelligence and machine learning powered technology platform aggregates, harmonizes and enriches vast amounts of global consumer shopping data from a myriad of diverse sources, generating rich, proprietary reference data and metadata and providing a global, omnichannel view of consumer shopping behavior. It operates through the following geographical segments: Americas, EMEA and APAC. The Americas segment includes North America and Latin America. The EMEA segment includes Europe, the Middle East and Africa. The APAC segment includes Asia and the western Pacific region. The company was founded on June 6, 2017 and is headquartered in Chicago, IL.",
"rbics_econ": "Technology",
"rbics_sector": "Software and Consulting",
"rbics_subsector": "Software",
"rbics_indgrp": "Enterprise Management Software",
"country_of_risk": "US"
